<h1>Lionel Messi <em>Height, Speed &amp; Athleticism</em></h1>
<div class="hero-meta">
<span class="hero-meta-item">📅 June 24, 2026</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">⚽ 2026 FIFA World Cup</span>
<span class="hero-meta-item">📊 Physical Profile</span>
</div>
<p class="hero-intro">
    Messi is 5 feet 7 inches tall, weighs 159 pounds, and just turned 38 years old. He scored his first-ever World Cup hat-trick against Algeria. His combine profile — if such a thing existed for soccer — would be unremarkable. His output is the greatest in the history of the sport. Here is the full breakdown of what his measurements reveal and what they miss entirely.
  </p>
</div><div class="article-wrap">
<div class="content">
<!-- SECTION 1 -->
<h2>The Full Athletic Profile</h2>
<div class="player-card">
<div class="player-name">Lionel Messi</div>
<div class="player-sub">Argentina · Forward · Inter Miami · Age 38 · 2026 World Cup</div>
<div class="player-stats">
